Usage: python3 payload_audit.py [--side left|right|both] [--predict]
       [--check CX,CY,CZ,KG] [--apply] [--from left|right] [-h|--help]
  --side S        which arm to read (default: both)
  --predict       mirror the OTHER arm's consensus onto this one
  --check V       compare a freshly measured record against the
                  prediction, e.g. --check 25.2,41.2,224.0,0.567
  --apply         WRITE the consensus onto every frame that deviates
  --from S        which side to take the consensus from (default: the
                  side with the tighter agreement)
  -h, --help      show this documentation and exit

